'''Thugs''' was created by {{player|Flamer|flag=cz}} and {{player|Billy The Kid|flag=ru}} was captain in the year [[2020]] after [[GetQuad Draft]] where Flamer picked {{player|Samon|flag=pl}}, {{player|Thunder|flag=pl}} and {{player|Billy The Kid|flag=ru}}. Then, in his first tournament, they finished on 3rd place. 

Later that year they started playing 2on2. After that, in [[GetQuad! Kenya Invitational 2]] they entered the playoffs without losing a single map, but losing the Semi Final against {{Flag/pl}} '''Polish team''' and then even losing the fight for 3rd place against {{Flag/eu}} '''Cocks'''.

